  m_Name: Level 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  briefing: 'When the vile warlord Hartkan seized power, young Prince Julian was
    forced to flee for his life at the tender age of four. Accompanied by his loyal
    knight, they escaped Candera and sought refuge in the free city of Majula.

    Having
    lost his family, Julian was groomed to reclaim the throne. He learned the ways
    of the sword, the art of war, politics, manners, and charm. Most importantly,
    he delved into the world of banking, recognizing the power that debt could wield
    in achieving seemingly impossible goals...

    With Hartkan''s forces away from
    Majula, Julian sees a prime opportunity to reclaim his homeland. Gathering his
    exiled supporters, all he needs is a seed loan to initiate the liberation of
    Majula.'
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 35e95846b77050d4bb57d56cd07bb402, type: 3}
